      type: "mcq",
      q: "Which sequence is most appropriate from the upper surface towards the lower surface?",
      options: [
        "Upper epidermis → palisade mesophyll → spongy mesophyll → lower epidermis",
        "Root hair → xylem → blood → epidermis",
        "Phloem → root hair → palisade → blood",
        "Lower epidermis → bone → muscle → xylem"
      ],
      answer: "Upper epidermis → palisade mesophyll → spongy mesophyll → lower epidermis",
